ame inside a bundled body, where the flag matters.\n1326:           (vec (import-calls (main-body ast)))))\n1381:                     (let [body (fn [d gf]\n1389:                           delivery (fn [] (conj [] {:package? false} body))\n1456:                                        (get-in % [:operator :body :test :operator :name])))\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
