{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"agent_message","text":"The existing emitters already separate code installation from runtime allocation, so I haven’t changed prelude rows. I’m adding regression checks for allocation-free repeated `py/init!`, isolation between consuming tasks, and installing `pysp` with its pinned `py` dependency without allocating runtime cells or requiring a signal stream.\n"}}
